{"meta":{"ph":"ˈstrætədʒi; NAmE ˈstrætədʒi","pos":"noun","stars":"★"},"defs":[{"def":"a plan that is intended to achieve a particular purpose 策略；计策；行动计划","ex":[{"s":"AI can help identify the slightest signs of decay, such as cracks or discoloration, which are often invisible to the human eye. _____38_____ Moreover, by predicting future decay patterns, AI helps museums take preventive measures and improve preservation strategies.","src":"2026新高考I卷·七选五","cat":"gaokao","year":2026,"t":"此外,通过预测未来的衰败模式,AI可____38____以帮助博物馆采取防范措施并改善保存策略。"},{"s":"Rereading because you did not understand is a reasonable fix-up strategy.","src":"2026浙江1月卷·七选五","cat":"gaokao","year":2026,"t":"因为没读懂而重读，是一种合理的补救策略。"},{"s":"Tu says that the balance between the black and white pieces, the beauty in the ____63____ (strategy) placement of the pieces, ____64____ the energy flow following each move inspired artists to create oil paintings, sculptures, ____65____ (digital) generated pictures and silk-screen prints for the exhibition.","src":"2025新高考I卷·语法填空","cat":"gaokao","year":2025,"t":"Tu说,黑白两块的平衡,棋子____63____摆放中的美,每次____64____移动后的能量流激励艺术家创作油画,雕____65____塑,为展览制作图片和丝屏印."},{"s":"I’ve been trying out these strategies and I’ve found that when I’m less restrictive, they do make better decisions.","src":"2025浙江1月卷·阅读理解B","cat":"gaokao","year":2025,"t":"我一直在尝试这些策略，发现当我更少限制时，他们确实做出更好的决定。"},{"s":"What does the author think of the strategies she has been following?","src":"2025浙江1月卷·阅读理解B","cat":"gaokao","year":2025,"t":"作者如何看待她一直遵循的策略？"},{"s":"Usually, better outcomes ____16____ (achieve) through a thorough understanding of strategies like risk tolerance.","src":"2025北京卷·语法填空","cat":"gaokao","year":2025,"t":"通常,通过对____16____风险容忍等战略的透彻了解,取得更好的结果。"},{"s":"You’ll hear these participants’ stories and learn what strategies worked well for them, and what traps they encountered that you should avoid.","src":"2023新课标I卷·阅读理解C","cat":"gaokao","year":2023,"t":"你会听到这些参与者的故事，了解哪些策略对他们有效，以及你应当避免哪些他们遇到的陷阱。"},{"s":"Campers who sign up for the 2-week secret agent camp can get to know about the life of real secret agents by learning strategies and military skills on the paintball field.","src":"2020全国新高考II卷·阅读理解A","cat":"gaokao","year":2020,"t":"报名两周秘密特工营的营员，可以通过在彩弹场上学习策略与军事技能，了解真实特工的生活。"},{"s":"According to an evolutionary psychology theory that a person's “life strategy” slows down or speeds up depending on his or her ___47___, exposure to a “harsh and unpredictable” environment leads to faster development, while a more resource-rich and secure environment has the ___48___ effect, the study said.","src":"2018上海卷·Section A","cat":"gaokao","year":2018,"t":"根据一种进化心理学理论,即一个人的“生活策略”视他或她的情况而放慢或____47____加快速度,接触“危险和不可预测的”环境会导致更快的发展,而资源更加丰富和安全的____48____环境则会产生效果。"},{"s":"Do you think “understanding cause and effect” was a useful strategy?","src":"人教选必2 U3","cat":"renjiao","t":"你认为“理解因果”是一种有用的策略吗?"}]},{"def":"the process of planning sth or putting a plan into operation in a skilful way 策划；规划；部署；统筹安排","ex":[{"s":"Again, your strategy is clear communication.","src":"外研社B3 U1","cat":"waiyan","t":"再次,你的策略是明确的沟通。"},{"s":"Do you have any effective marketing strategies?","src":"人教B2 U5","cat":"renjiao","t":"你有有效的营销策略吗?"},{"s":"Do you think the “asking questions” strategy was useful in understanding the texts?","src":"人教选必2 U1","cat":"renjiao","t":"你认为“提问”战略有助于理解案文吗?"},{"s":"Global development strategies help to make connections between China and the rest of the world.","src":"人教选必2 U2","cat":"renjiao","t":"全球发展战略有助于中国与世界其他地区建立联系。"}]},{"def":"the skill of planning the movements of armies in a battle or war; an example of doing this 战略；战略部署","ex":[]}]}